{:schema :wm/codex-fold-plan-v1
 :prompt-prefix "Produce the enriched V1 fold output for this RUN4 construction. Return exactly one EDN map with :wiring {:boxes [...]}, a NEGATIVE numeric :coverage-score-delta, and :policy-holes [...]. Every box has a unique keyword :id, nonblank :role, :fits-pattern {:pattern/id STRING-FROM-SHOWN :pattern/revision NONBLANK-STRING}, :warrant-kind in #{:pattern :worked-example :deduction}, and :conditions as a vector. Every condition is {:condition NONBLANK-STRING :status one-of-:established-:absent-:unchecked} plus :witness for established/unchecked or :obstruction for absent. An optional box :hole is {:kind KEYWORD :wanted NONBLANK-STRING :obligation/id KEYWORD-OR-NONBLANK-STRING}, optionally with keyword :discharge/:satiety. Every policy hole is {:free NONBLANK-STRING :why NONBLANK-STRING :unfolded-pattern PATTERN-ID :obligation/id KEYWORD-OR-NONBLANK-STRING}. Account for every shown cascade pattern through a box :fits-pattern id or policy-hole :unfolded-pattern. A genuine inability may instead return {:fold/refused true :why NONBLANK-STRING :refusal/class KEYWORD}."
}
